               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Managed advertising campaigns and created digital content for 6</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Managed advertising campaigns and created digital content for 6 subsidiary locations across Southern Ontario. Generated 1000+ sales leads with paid campaigns, further optimizing ad conversion rate effectiveness through A/B analysis. Assisted in-club sales teams with customer inquiries, contributing to above-target sales for the 2022 fiscal year. </photoshop:LayerText>
