               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Created social media strategies, increasing engagement and visi</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Created social media strategies, increasing engagement and visibility of qualified leads by up to 40% across key platforms. Drafted wireframes, marketing collateral, and dashboards using Figma, Adobe CC, and PowerBI according to strict design guidelines. Performed SEO audit to establish companyâ€™s online presence, boosting search rank from unrated to 4th  top search in target keywords. </photoshop:LayerText>
