               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Created 1000+ hours of branded content for AONest, a self-guide</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Created 1000+ hours of branded content for AONest, a self-guided mental health software, across web, social, and email channels. Collaborated with executives and key stakeholders to develop a strategic media rollout aligned with reconciliation objectives. Analyzed audience metrics to inform marketing decisions and gage reconciliation effectiveness, establishing a data-driven approach. </photoshop:LayerText>
