                  <photoshop:LayerText>Data-driven marketing and business professional with a Bachelor of Arts from the University of Waterloo, specializing in transforming complex, raw information into clear, engaging visual stories. Experienced in analytics, marketing campaigns, presentations, and content creation. Passionate about combining creative storytelling with data-driven marketing strategies.</photoshop:LayerText>
